Other methods to fight the nymph without breaking its fragiles or
getting your stuff stolen include:
* lure your starting pet to stay with you,
* slow monster, then hit and run,
* any attack wand or spell except striking, but beware the rebound,
* sleeping the nymph, then ordinary melee*,
* taming / charm monster,
* genocide*,
* step on an Elbereth square prepared in advance, then conflict,
* levitate on Elbereth, then melee,
* lock the nymph away with Elbereth+gold, then throw junk* at it,
* lead it into a trap if pre-damaged,
* polymorph it if you're desperate.*

*: These tactics have drawbracks. Finding them is left as an exercise
to the reader.

In any case, it pays to think this through before you dip into
fountains.


